{"sections":[{"slug":"Atiyah--Singer指标定理","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Atiyah--Singer指标定理"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Atiyah–Singer <span lang=\"zh\">指标定理</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Atiyah–Singer 指标定理"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p>Atiyah–Singer <span lang=\"zh\">指标定理在流形上整体地描述微分方程的拓扑</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/椭圆算子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆算子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拓扑指标","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拓扑指标</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">等于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/解析指标","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">解析指标</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Nicolaescu, Notes on the Atiyah-Singer Index Theorem</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> Dirac <span lang=\"zh\">丛</span>, $D$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> Dirac <span lang=\"zh\">算子</span>, $F^{E/\\mathbb S}\\in \\operatorname{End}_{\\mathrm{Cl}(M)}(E)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为曲率</span> (twisting curvature), <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈特征","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈特征</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{ch}^{E/\\mathbb S}:= \\operatorname{str}^{E/\\mathbb S} \\exp\\left(\\frac{i}{2\\pi} F^{E/\\mathbb S}\\right) \\in\\Omega^\\bullet(M),\r\n$$\n"},{"Local":{"url":"/A-hat类","text":"A-hat <span lang=\"zh\">类</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\widehat{A}(M)=\\det \\left(\\frac{\\frac{i}{4\\pi}R}{\\sinh (\\frac{i}{4\\pi}R)}\\right)^{1/2},\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> Atiyah–Singer <span lang=\"zh\">定理是说</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{ind}D=\\dim\\ker D -\\dim\\ker D^* =\\int_M \\widehat{A}(M) \\operatorname{ch}^{E/\\mathbb S}(E).\r\n$$</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>John W. Morgan, The Seiberg–Witten Equations and Applications …, 3.3 <span lang=\"zh\">节</span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为闭可定向</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">四维流形</span>, $\\widetilde P$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的自旋结构</span>, $\\partial \\hspace{-5pt}/$ <span lang=\"zh\">为复旋量丛</span> $S_{\\mathbb{C}}^+(\\widetilde P)$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $S_{\\mathbb{C}}^-(\\widetilde P)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Dirac算子","text":"Dirac <span lang=\"zh\">算子</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">由其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/象征","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">象征</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">可计算其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/解析指标","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">解析指标</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">如下</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">回忆对于</span> $\\pi\\colon T^*X\\to X$, <span lang=\"zh\">象征是</span> $T^*X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的向量丛</span> $\\pi^* S^+$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\pi^* S^-$ <span lang=\"zh\">的丛同态</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这个丛同态在</span> $T^*X\\setminus X$ (<span lang=\"zh\">减去零截面</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">上的限制是丛的同构</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">因此</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">象征给出了</span> $T^*X$ <span lang=\"zh\">相对于</span> $T^*X\\setminus X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/相对K-群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">相对</span> K-<span lang=\"zh\">群</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">拓扑</span>)"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的一个元素</span>. Atiyah–Singer <span lang=\"zh\">指标定理即是说</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">由这个相对</span> K-<span lang=\"zh\">理论的元素可计算出解析指标</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}